+# Plan: authored Markdown knowledge bundles
+
+## Constraints
+
+- Keep the bundle schema and existing import path unchanged.
+- Keep the authoring implementation in the domain layer and framework-free.
+- Qualify each document key with the collection key before generating section keys.
+- Parse headings only outside fenced code; preserve deterministic section/table order.
+- Drop empty sections and filter colloquial mappings to emitted section keys.
+- Use fixed manifest generator metadata and deterministic record ordering.
+
+## Tasks
+
+### 1. Markdown section parser
+
+- **Files:** create `backend/src/pharma_agent/domain/corpus/authoring.py`; create `backend/tests/domain/corpus/test_authoring.py`.
+- **Interfaces:** provides `AuthoredSection` and `split_markdown`; uses existing `BlockRecord` and `BlockKind`.
+- **Done when:** focused tests prove fallback/preamble handling, fenced heading exclusion, nested heading paths, empty-section removal, stripped prose blocks, table runs, and document-wide table keys. Run `uv run pytest tests/domain/corpus/test_authoring.py` from `backend/` and observe pass after implementation.
+
+### 2. Slugs, keys, and choices
+
+- **Files:** modify `backend/src/pharma_agent/domain/corpus/authoring.py`; extend `backend/tests/domain/corpus/test_authoring.py`.
+- **Interfaces:** provides `slugify`, `section_key`, and `section_choices`; uses `AuthoredDocument` and `BundleCollection`.
+- **Done when:** focused tests prove Vietnamese transliteration, ASCII/hyphen normalization and length limit, body keys, collection-qualified section keys, and choice order/labels. Run the focused test and observe pass.
+
+### 3. Bundle assembly
+
+- **Files:** modify `backend/src/pharma_agent/domain/corpus/authoring.py`; extend `backend/tests/domain/corpus/test_authoring.py`.
+- **Interfaces:** provides `AuthoredDocument` and `build_bundle`; uses parser/key helpers and existing bundle models.
+- **Done when:** focused tests prove sorted qualified documents, section records and paths, glossary retention, missing mapping-key filtering, manifest collection/counts, and repeated `bundle_digest` equality. Run the focused test and observe pass, then run `uv run pytest` from `backend/` and fix failures.
